Each variant must attack the topic from a DIFFERENT angle. Choose
{{ n }} different angles from this list — one per variant:

  • THE COUNTERINTUITIVE TAKE — argue against the obvious position
  • THE CONCRETE MOMENT — a specific scene from someone's day
  • THE COST OF INACTION — what happens if they don't change
  • THE COMPARISON — two approaches side by side
  • THE REFRAME — swap the framing everyone uses for a better one
  • THE UNEXPECTED ANALOGY — borrow a metaphor from a different field

Do not paraphrase. Each variant is a genuinely different post.

